cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "Machina: An AI Agent Framework for Industrial Maintenance"
abstract: >
  Machina is an open-source Python framework for building AI agents
  specialized in industrial maintenance (predictive, preventive, corrective).
  It provides connectors for maintenance systems (CMMS, spreadsheets and SQL
  databases, IoT protocols, document stores, messaging), a canonical
  maintenance domain model, an LLM-powered agent layer with domain-aware
  prompting, and a Model Context Protocol server.

